    "No CUSAXXXXX and/or CUSAXXXXX-patch folder found in\n{}\n\nPut Gravity Rush 2 and its 1.11 update beside Gravity Rush 2™.exe: either two folders, the game and the update (for example CUSA04934 and CUSA04934-patch), or one folder with the update copied over the game. Folders and .zar archives both work.\n\n{}": "Folder CUSAXXXXX dan/atau CUSAXXXXX-patch tidak ditemukan di\n{}\n\nLetakkan Gravity Rush 2 dan pembaruan 1.11 di samping Gravity Rush 2™.exe: bisa dua folder, game dan pembaruan (misalnya CUSA04934 dan CUSA04934-patch), atau satu folder dengan pembaruan yang disalin menimpa game. Folder maupun arsip .zar bisa dipakai.\n\n{}",
    "No {} folder found beside {}. GR2port needs the game as well as its update: put the game beside it as {}, or copy the update over the game folder.\n\n{}": "Folder {} tidak ditemukan di samping {}. GR2port memerlukan game beserta pembaruannya: letakkan game di sampingnya sebagai {}, atau salin pembaruan menimpa folder game.\n\n{}",
    "{} cannot be opened. Your game files may be corrupted.": "{} tidak dapat dibuka. File game Anda mungkin rusak.",
    "No {} folder found. {} holds version {} of the game, and GR2port needs the 1.11 update: put it beside the game as {}, or copy it over the game folder.\n\n{}": "Folder {} tidak ditemukan. {} berisi versi {} game, dan GR2port memerlukan pembaruan 1.11: letakkan di samping game sebagai {}, atau salin menimpa folder game.\n\n{}",
    "The update in {} is version {}. GR2port needs Gravity Rush 2 update 1.11.": "Pembaruan di {} adalah versi {}. GR2port memerlukan pembaruan 1.11 Gravity Rush 2.",
